{
    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "We stay true to the classic Solitaire (also known as Patience Solitaire).\r\nSolitaire is funny, addictive, and challenging brain games. The gameplay is very simple to start but hard to master. \r\nOur game is the most easy-to-play with clean and intuitive designs. Meanwhile, we have added many beautiful themes and Daily challenges for you.\r\n\r\nJust single tap or drag and drop to move the card, and use the shortest time and moves get the highest scores. Simple and addicting!\r\n\r\n==============Features==============\r\n\u2660 Customizable beautiful themes\r\n\u2660 Daily Challenge\r\n\u2660 Unlimited free undo\r\n\u2660 Unlimited free hints\r\n\u2660 Draw 1 card\r\n\u2660 Draw 3 cards\r\n\u2660 Auto-collect cards on completion\r\n\u2660 Auto-save game in play\r\n\u2660 Track your records\r\n\u2660 Left-handed model\r\n\u2660 Tablet support\r\n\u2660 Switch Portrait or Landscape view mode\r\n\r\nTrain your brain as well as kill time with friends together!\r\nHave fun playing Solitaire!",
    "descriptionHTML": "We stay true to the classic Solitaire (also known as Patience Solitaire).<br>Solitaire is funny, addictive, and challenging brain games. The gameplay is very simple to start but hard to master. <br>Our game is the most easy-to-play with clean and intuitive designs. Meanwhile, we have added many beautiful themes and Daily challenges for you.<br><br>Just single tap or drag and drop to move the card, and use the shortest time and moves get the highest scores. Simple and addicting!<br><br>==============Features==============<br>\u2660 Customizable beautiful themes<br>\u2660 Daily Challenge<br>\u2660 Unlimited free undo<br>\u2660 Unlimited free hints<br>\u2660 Draw 1 card<br>\u2660 Draw 3 cards<br>\u2660 Auto-collect cards on completion<br>\u2660 Auto-save game in play<br>\u2660 Track your records<br>\u2660 Left-handed model<br>\u2660 Tablet support<br>\u2660 Switch Portrait or Landscape view mode<br><br>Train your brain as well as kill time with friends together!<br>Have fun playing Solitaire!",
